Where the light lands.

Plum / BR-01 =C2=B7 Evening
The dark dome holds the outline of the lamp. Below it, a narrow rim of light =
picks out each rib in the glass. Blue dusk still catches one side of the shad=
e while the lamp warms the wood directly below.

